{%- comment -%}
  Sliding fill variant of the button hover (Theme settings > Buttons & Controls > "Sliding fill animation on hover").
  Generated from the ::before fill rules; turns the default colour fade into a left-to-right slide.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
